  "description": "PROVISIONAL - Dual Active Bridge between a 350 V bench-fed HV side (450 V-class 4.08 mF link) and a stiff-capacitor 96 V LV pack. Both bridges modeled average: the phase shift (radians) is driven per control period by the scenario host via set_input / plant-input. Both buses carry their own supplies: the HV side also sources/sinks from a bench unit like a traction-bus emulator; the LV pack absorbs transfer as voltage change. Winding losses and transformer saturation are not part of this average model - every constant here is a provisional stand-in pending real measurements (dual polarity incl. the LV receive convention is the machinery being proven, not the magnitudes).",
